},"mobile":{"bottom":0,"left":0,"right":0,"top":0}},"responsiveMobileContainersInversion":false}},{"columns":[{"containers":[{"blocks":[{"content":"\n                       <p class=\"es-m-txt-l\" style=\"color: #16243d; font-size: 16px\"><strong>You already know what works: a few minutes, most days.</strong></p>\n                       <p class=\"es-m-txt-l\" style=\"color: #16243d; font-size: 16px\">That beats an hour you’ll skip twice and quit by Friday.</p>\n                       <p class=\"es-m-txt-l\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #16243d\">So why is it still so hard to keep going?</p>\n                       <p class=\"es-m-txt-l\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #16243d\">🔥 Because a random workout isn’t a plan.</p>\n                       <p class=\"es-m-txt-l\" style=\"color: #16243d; font-size: 16px\">🔥 Because “just train more” leaves you guessing.</p>\n                       <p class=\"es-m-txt-l\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #16243d\">🔥 Because Day 3 shows up and nothing tells you what’s next.</p>\n                       <p class=\"es-m-txt-l\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #16243d\"><strong>That’s why Fiteno <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://fiteno.app/checkout/?email=%EMAIL%&uuid=%EXTERNAL_CUSTOMER_ID%\" style=\"color: #FF5A3C; text-decoration: underline; font-size: 16px\">builds the plan for you</a> — sessions from 7 minutes that adapt when life gets in the way, so you always know exactly what today looks like.</strong></p>\n                       <p class=\"es-m-txt-l\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #16243d\"><strong>Your first 4 weeks are 75% off — $9.99 instead of $39.99, then $39.99 every 4 weeks. Cancel anytime.</strong></p>\n                       <p class=\"es-m-txt-l\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #16243d\">You can keep planning to start. Or you can start.</p>","id":"af279b8b-f809-4101-81ba-839dd74e15a8","settings":{"backgroundColor":"transparent","fontColor":"#16243d","hideElement":"no","includeInOutput":"both","padding":{"d